    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Act quickly to purchase this spacious two bedroom top floor apartment in the sought after development of St Ive's. 3 Minutes walk to the centre of Malahide Village this property is sure to attract many first-time buyers/investors. The apartment itself has been well maintained by its owner and it is in walk in condition throughout. 12 St. Ives has bright spacious accommodation throughout and benefits from a sunny west-facing aspect. balcony.\r\n\r\nMalahide is a beautiful seaside village that enjoys a unique and very prestigious atmosphere aided by the historic Malahide Castle with its landscaped grounds as well as the picturesque Marina. There are many sports in the area to choose from eg tennis, cricket, sailing, Gaelic, football."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance into the block (only 4 units with access)\r\n\r\n2nd Floor Apartment (Spacious Top Floor Apartment)\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall (3.96 x 1.06 and 3.18 x 0.94) (L Shape) laminate flooring, intercom\r\n\r\nBedroom One (2.52 x 0.91) laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes, built-in units with mirror\r\n\r\nBedroom Two (3.21 x 2.59) Double bedroom with laminate flooring and slider wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.42 x 2.02) with wc, whb, bath/electric triton shower, fully tiled, extractor fan, window, Dimplex heater, recessed lights\r\n\r\nKitchen (3.16 x 2.92) bright room, wall and floor mounted units, tiled between, cooker, plumbed for washing machine, ss sink\r\n\r\nLounge (4.06 x 3.84) bright room with natural light coming in from the glass-panelled sliding door, laminate flooring, feature open fireplace with wooden surround, tv point, access to balcony off"
      },
      {
